zj/thumb/2/23/iitecchqm56xqnix2pt28c7epl9t51a.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E8%A1%80%E5%A4%9C%E4%B9%8B%E7%BA%A6.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/23/iitecchqm56xqnix2pt28c7epl9t51a.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E8%A1%80%E5%A4%9C%E4%B9%8B%E7%BA%A6.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/2/23/iitecchqm56xqnix2pt28c7epl9t51a.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />血夜之约\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>对单位\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-2\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓8-↑8\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（减益）牺牲<font color=\"#ed7950\">35%</font>当前生命值，暂时离场，并对目标施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"怨念之痕\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">怨念之痕</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"血夜之约\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">血夜之约</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>回合。[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"血夜之约\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">血夜之约</font></span></span>]结束后，对目标造成施法者生命值加物攻值之和的<font color=\"#ed7950\">35%</font>伤害，无视其<font color=\"#ed7950\">100%</font>防御，并产生<font color=\"#58cb48\">80%</font>[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"生命汲取\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">生命汲取</font></span></span>]，立刻触发其[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"感染\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">感染</font></span></span>]效果，无视[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"先制\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">先制</font></span></span>]、无视[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"闪避\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">闪避</font></span></span>]。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-2 0.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/40/2gfpcz0gruh7uvz5hjs6kohxsqy1j9d.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-2_0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/4/40/2gfpcz0gruh7uvz5hjs6kohxsqy1j9d.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%A5%87%E4%BA%9A\" title=\"角色图鉴库/奇亚\"><img alt=\"头像 奇亚.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/4/45/gau26hcbbgmkvf80m54tokkuq4g38ju.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width